#: scenario3:scenario3_88E8A41E_A9B3_4AD5_BB26_E648A814EDB1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 31ff26964dcd326f88489a31ceefdd6d9cb3c04577b6b16c2a33b0506e99a86b
#. default-sha256: 6d164733681d6569830de7d2bfd96dc2125c878ccc12022412001c21ddee8f58
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_88E8A41E_A9B3_4AD5_BB26_E648A814EDB1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 60bb39048f07791fedcdfb9e084dd6822d014985e4aacfdcb4863a9984b90730
#. default-sha256: 3cfb3d016acc5a3e44277216537f0fc858e6747336fdee7568865366206f3480
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A4D825DA_EBE9_49C2_91AB_B085D9CB8EA5"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Looking down dejectedly at the undrunken tea, the White-Haired Girl walked alone down the "
"corridor."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫白い髪の娘は、⟪k:1⟫誰にも飲まれなかった紅茶を寂しげに見つめながら、⟪k:2⟫たったひとり、⟪k:3⟫廊"
"下を歩いておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 354c7ad58b572880b169b7f63eb3fd70ed0992fb536d3e424cebda8c660ad047
#. default-sha256: dcd2da6af9641a4125a55ddee7701eea2f59f0e9ee8a89d21c798ef64ab88f2f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_F7BCD182_8814_4357_9D96_A99E95E4FC85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though its calming scent filled the air, there was nobody around to have their heart warmed "
"by it."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫心を落ち着かせるような香りが周囲に漂おうとも、⟪k:1⟫それに穏やかな笑みを見せてくれる人など、"
"⟪k:2⟫誰もおりません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d38b67ab35959f5c7405f353379af1fb6e68a7fa6ff9f5bb0ce9a4c2968b2418
#. default-sha256: 35a71b069d04da43fdcde0bbd51e40b9b56dcd780fb385a189b8a8098b515f7d
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8B9C3D09_7F27_4EB1_A73D_A37B088B6E26"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Nor was there anyone to alleviate her loneliness."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女の孤独をねぎらう人も……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2abd3d3de9760b08769d2b7aefb01727363139411ce20bab6ece79afabc3622
#. default-sha256: ef85f682fd9336f966ca3d456b8769ec31cd9ab437e82cc8a20ca207a011dfa4
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_773BF3F5_3E27_413D_B02F_76AAC10204C2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Despite being the master’s wife, the maids who crossed her path in the halls said nary a "
"word to her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫この館の奥方であるというのに、⟪k:1⟫廊下を行き交うメイドたちは、⟪k:2⟫彼女に声をかけようともし"
"ないのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4d026d919c1781e09e16950b4342642b431b6b2660847cea3d76b6d52d6efb75
#. default-sha256: ebb8dbe630102fe29ffc8cfa496d48a45ac16b09ec227bb87d16f6d95a2eafa9
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B9F11270_C774_4CE1_82C9_98BFE4C943F9"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D1CC945B_1426_486D_A007_7D0E685D60C7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36d5fd85a2e1f50887c8d7dc745f07fb20e4efe4a2154437933afec360d42f0d
#. default-sha256: fa66bc0816304fc739d993e8a5d65e9bc8eaff0f8a115c0fa7080c10a6902325
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D1CC945B_1426_486D_A007_7D0E685D60C7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫As a matter of fact—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫いいえ、⟪k:1⟫それどころか―――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2648BE34_8454_4A6E_A4B9_1544D81DC629
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 255f3f2de686bfc12490de81bfbaab5389c16c61c1412b9fd6f19962d4651abc
#. default-sha256: 0cd4c5214fc6cf5529457b2bcf83a78e0653c6e59f07a9dda0bfd2f7a7a33be0
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2648BE34_8454_4A6E_A4B9_1544D81DC629"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫...!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫…………ッ！"

#: scenario3:scenario3_3FDDECF2_46DB_4622_9B83_A8AD0DCF0D84
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d810414a87cca88344f49a233f84bfbcd5800ac2aafcef4d7fe52a824bb79753
#. default-sha256: b06c79880d3e21c418b45c08ff1bd3ecb4610d6884b00505a0cb70ae896f9a57
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3FDDECF2_46DB_4622_9B83_A8AD0DCF0D84"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Oh dear.⟪k:8⟫I beg your pardon, Madam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫\t\t⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫あらぁっ、⟪k:8⟫ごめんなさい奥様？"

#: scenario3:scenario3_B4165425_8A41_45A9_87B1_4540C8B167C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3077be24bee026ddd54c9ccd8f506d3b9548c6e453c65b621e1a322b125a5caf
#. default-sha256: 56f00823b15c41643962cfbedbf25c56228529506001e8100d2490e3e99d0779
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_B4165425_8A41_45A9_87B1_4540C8B167C8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ah... ⟪k:1⟫it’s fine..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫あ……、⟪k:1⟫いえ………。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9747367B_ECC6_47EA_B0E3_2CB573183AC4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 12073f757b2b8fae24e08d36d946d02d361b5ed03e9e3b0f7cc69ef4ba690eb8
#. default-sha256: 123d092864b0f413e9140d18c53a743efdae948931d78662fce9fe0e22090bcf
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9747367B_ECC6_47EA_B0E3_2CB573183AC4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—one even bumped into her, stifling a laugh as she trotted off."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫彼女にぶつかって、⟪k:1⟫くすくすと笑い声を忍ばせながら、⟪k:2⟫立ち去っていく者すらいるのです"
"わ。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_CD736832_7BEC_4174_A5C4_33B2132F2C71
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4e3028aad6bd2a6d873769633c2513fec491d92a0f56e8a1f69fe1ecc6c4626
#. default-sha256: 9051de5fb6e477fc2e96cb8fd97387abefc933bcd4338898c04dd9e43af59904
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_CD736832_7BEC_4174_A5C4_33B2132F2C71"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In all likelihood, she had done it intentionally. ⟪k:1⟫The poor White-Haired Girl, who had "
"fallen to the floor, stared helplessly at the broken cups."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫大方、⟪k:1⟫わざとやったのでしょう。⟪k:2⟫可哀想に、⟪k:3⟫転んでしまった白い髪の娘は、⟪k:4⟫途方"
"にくれた様子で割れた食器を見つめておりました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_755AD335_1E15_49D6_A108_2117706A1AC7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 42bd72418d97b48c4169320d8c855e7987cbaf81c16abcef635fb2cf32e4dd62
#. default-sha256: 9241b3ee7cf9475678ab4b4f44e11083b7a882340b01e332149ff77246cf3a62
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_755AD335_1E15_49D6_A108_2117706A1AC7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The tea she had made for her husband was forming a stain in the carpet."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫せっかく、⟪k:1⟫夫のために淹れた紅茶も、⟪k:2⟫カーペットの染みとなるばかりです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D9217328_537E_44AE_A7D1_F2142D1419F2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeed9edb2c4f72f0bda5b6287f3e31a8c7c19bcdb94a72957b54a737aa66ba74
#. default-sha256: 658319acbaf9730fd4b9db3803da904530ee652cb8ab6d1469f55f46c975f90f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D9217328_537E_44AE_A7D1_F2142D1419F2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The maids’ behavior toward the mistress of the house was absolutely unacceptable."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫メイドがこのような振る舞いを、⟪k:1⟫主人の奥方にするなんて、⟪k:2⟫あるまじきことでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FCE0642B_DBE2_4935_A25D_FAE1492D1023
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bcf8ea9bcdbc99d821582816b8e200561cbffd7173745bd282a5230697242c40
#. default-sha256: bdf580099e85494b3d09c8535bae80004f49492eed5daeaf1539f76dd9ccc1b5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FCE0642B_DBE2_4935_A25D_FAE1492D1023"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nonetheless, it was commonplace—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫all because of the way Jacopo treated her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫それなのに、⟪k:1⟫この屋敷ではまかり通っていたのです。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それもすべて、⟪k:4⟫ヤコポの振"
"る舞いが原因でした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_D68D42FA_CF32_457E_9CB5_30FBC93EEFC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c177136d13b9b2276bf63abebbf4838a0bb5ce60e41f46b0d91302387d3dba64
#. default-sha256: b823a43abd60fbc5124a8d0eecc6228f52ba691ab549ec247dabc481a3ce1e96
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_D68D42FA_CF32_457E_9CB5_30FBC93EEFC8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The more the man of the house acted cruel to her,⟪k:1⟫the less weight her position as his "
"wife held to the servants."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫屋敷の主人が妻に対し手ひどい扱いをするものですから、⟪k:1⟫妻の立場はどんどん悪くなるのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_1855FFDE_01E4_46FF_B383_E9128B81C961
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03f7ac7dc1e12fb84ef3358e8477c6ae8c3d180c9d1b27b98c0a9364b89b268c
#. default-sha256: 45ff4e296b0b5998fba7d45e4497a23bbb36d5e275d2254e34fb2544a71f8609
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_1855FFDE_01E4_46FF_B383_E9128B81C961"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Day in and day out, the maids worked busily—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫offered little opportunity for leisure—"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫so they would naturally have accumulated quite a bit of stress."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫娯楽もなく、⟪k:1⟫忙しなく働く毎日をメイドたちも送っておりますから、⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫それなりに鬱憤も"
"溜まるのでしょう。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_93CD596B_710F_4B6D_A9BE_C45CAFB41920
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45ac5fa4848fc010a4f6fe734729929e89396a9821c0e592e38a999350c7fcca
#. default-sha256: fb022a86289ebaac55db503e115c43729c8a26efddcc8af48ee2540a6ba4b497
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_93CD596B_710F_4B6D_A9BE_C45CAFB41920"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And she became the target for them to let off this steam."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫それを、⟪k:1⟫あろうことか彼女に対して吐き出すのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_A6A74DB4_B6EB_4691_8E51_D0B71446E496
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c81468cd1f291d2d119186bf2f2e82acb658c55d0f28c49094d89f2d3a2c0596
#. default-sha256: c0e58e94fe080eac51d693dc2b7c7e4aa020059cb2110852eea1bbadd77436ae
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A6A74DB4_B6EB_4691_8E51_D0B71446E496"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not directly, but through a more subdued kind of harassment from the shadows."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫直接的にではなく、⟪k:1⟫このように、⟪k:2⟫陰湿な嫌がらせとして。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_C90492EF_7D04_424F_9879_017BF694F1CA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c703bb57a11966ad9d06103797f614807a5c1ce16d272d9d9730102fed2607b
#. default-sha256: d1a7271c282cdc9352f8e685c949ab14ca9181fca1e7b829fd41cb9a4b9334d1
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_C90492EF_7D04_424F_9879_017BF694F1CA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She must have felt quite miserable. ⟪k:1⟫I imagine she would have been better off as one of "
"the maids."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫当の本人からしてみれば、⟪k:1⟫みじめなものでしょう。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫まだ、⟪k:4⟫同じメイドの立場で"
"あった方が、⟪k:5⟫良かったかもしれません。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_FB205E25_E6F8_4865_B3E7_3319368D8FCC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f0d3d523451ee056a5abe7db9b22a79df37e08d07d6731e6927ac192c87c3c1
#. default-sha256: 2c8677e809b6525418a5b63dcd05afa2e91facfc8c8f93e33064ec5dcbf43225
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_FB205E25_E6F8_4865_B3E7_3319368D8FCC"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫On the surface, and in front of others, they showed respect for her as Jacopo’s bride. But "
"behind closed doors, they acted very much the opposite."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫表向き、⟪k:1⟫他人の前ではヤコポの妻として敬われますが――、⟪k:2⟫裏ではこの仕打ち。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_E95184CC_AC3F_4BCB_A653_912ADADA02DF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 950a252e2683e9577a3c63dc7c93e011b451046c8bef7a4ea9c15c9e523ec191
#. default-sha256: 7ad495e6087f2e1e6e26ee2444a713689a0931c5ab7bfec382692e65c1eb0d09
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_E95184CC_AC3F_4BCB_A653_912ADADA02DF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The disparity between the treatment she received around others—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫the treatment she "
"was ⟪k:3⟫supposed⟪k:4⟫ to receive at all times—⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫and the way she was actually treated "
"made the abuse that much worse."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫本来そうされるべき表の態度と、⟪k:1⟫現実での裏の態度。⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫その差が、⟪k:4⟫彼女を余計打ち"
"のめすのです。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_267EE02A_941F_4448_8B47_CA74E017EE6D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 820b7bf6dfb5d96e0d068c0bb59b6dcb793f3da02deff183577a127d4db61b8c
#. default-sha256: a0298420fafd84d256c24da1ab1de61367606666df741ce6b89abaddd978b210
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_267EE02A_941F_4448_8B47_CA74E017EE6D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And furthermore, as you have seen through the other doors, Master, she was a very reserved "
"young woman."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫更に、⟪k:1⟫彼女は今まで旦那さまが見てこられたように、⟪k:2⟫とても控えめな人でしたから。⟪k:3⟫声"
"に出して、⟪k:4⟫メイドたちを非難することも――"

#: scenario3:scenario3_9BDAD077_9CE6_4C39_8E22_6ABFFEE3ECF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 002dc646de160c2e48beebe8233c34b9409ea7d398a3ebae5600b209ac44812b
#. default-sha256: d4d61928f4e0a5c613da3ec141c8c5d1015f18926f73ca881be0c06734293c1b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_9BDAD077_9CE6_4C39_8E22_6ABFFEE3ECF1"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She could neither raise her voice in reprimand nor raise her hand in retaliation."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫態度として、⟪k:1⟫彼女たちに反抗することも、⟪k:2⟫出来ないのでした。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_2D2FF13F_3EAF_4424_8601_4E4DA6F69371
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c187b1da82a90247c5221d9af87e20372f2b93adb4e20d4cc0b512cc3f082867
#. default-sha256: fbcbbbf8cb5136d900a988463f56f4bff2121c3651ba94bbf0a2df838991681f
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_2D2FF13F_3EAF_4424_8601_4E4DA6F69371"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I have to get this cleaned up..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫……片づけないと……。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_01A7312C_4E02_430F_B6A7_45F2AA7F94C5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b24fc2ed70fe457624b530989a9104a737f44ad670e3663d9e1011b368ac4363
#. default-sha256: 13facd85d2cf7fb097695e8ae4bb0839885db94c0cc0068cef07f56a0ca96501
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_01A7312C_4E02_430F_B6A7_45F2AA7F94C5"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫She extended her spindly fingers toward the shards of shattered porcelain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫彼女は、⟪k:1⟫細く繊細な指を、⟪k:2⟫割れた陶器に伸ばしました。"

#: scenario3:scenario3_6C35B0D2_1AEF_4680_A1A4_3B4661C2E547
